---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import ComingSoon from "../components/ComingSoon.astro";
---
<Base title="atHand: Your Info, Ready" description="atHand keeps your personal reference information on your iPhone and shows the right record when you need it.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Your info, ready when you need it</h1>
    <p class="lede">atHand keeps the details you look up all the time, such as people, vehicles, pets, homes, financial accounts, and contacts, in one place on your iPhone.</p>
    <ComingSoon />

    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p>You add your reference information to atHand, or scan documents like a driver’s license, passport, insurance card, VIN, or vaccine record with your camera.</p>
    <p>Your information stays on your iPhone. Scanning runs on the device, so your images are not sent anywhere.</p>
    <p>atHand uses signals on your device to bring up the records that are likely to matter right now. Calendar and location signals are optional.</p>
    <p>You can lock the app with Face ID or your device passcode, and export an encrypted backup protected by a passphrase only you know.</p>

    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="privacy-summary">
      <h2 id="privacy-summary">Privacy in short</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Your information is stored only on your iPhone.</li>
        <li>There is no account and no sign-in.</li>
        <li>The developer runs no server and cannot see your information.</li>
        <li>No advertising, tracking, analytics, or crash-reporting tools.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Read the <a href="/privacy.html">full privacy policy</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <h2>Learn more</h2>
    <ul class="links">
      <li><a href="/privacy.html">Privacy policy</a></li>
      <li><a href="/support.html">Support and help</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
